    "description": "Tests for my Pet Clinic REST API (Lab 11, Capstone Milestone 3). Covers create, read, update and delete, validation and not-found errors, pagination, sorting, species filtering and the page-size cap. Run the requests in order so the saved pet ID is available.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "58206198",
